      "description": "The identifier-lookup CLIENT a reader's browser runs: `lookup.js` (plain ES module, no dependencies) with its hand-written `lookup.d.ts`, and a one-form `index.html` told which index to open by `?index=<directory>`. The indexes themselves are generated output hosted by the instance each is about (its own `id-lookup/`), never here. JavaScript, so it never sits under the plain docs pipeline. Moved from large-datasets (bean `j7ql`).",
